Article 2 (Goods Subject to Duties) The goods subject to anti-dumping duties shall be polyvinyl chloride paste resin originating from Germany, France, Norway, and Sweden (meaning goods classified under item No. 3904.10.0000 of the Harmonized Tariff and Statistical Schedule under Article 98 (1) of the Enforcement Decree of the Customs Act): Provided, That suspension polyvinyl chloride satisfying all of the following requirements shall be excluded:
1. Manufactured by suspension polymerization [a polymerization method in which a monomer is dispersed into small droplets in water by using a dispersion stabilizer];
2. Mainly used for rigid construction pipes and similar products, and having no viscosity value;
3. Having an average particle size of at least 100 micrometers (μm) but not more than 180 micrometers (μm).
